culator\";\r\n\r\n# Conclusion\r\n\r\nCongratulations! You've completed the `Create your SDK with Codama` course. You now have a solid foundation in understanding how Codama IDL works, from its core concepts to practical implementation details.\r\n\r\n## What You've Learned\r\n\r\nThroughout this course, you've gained essential knowledge about:\r\n- What is Codama and how `nodes`, `visitors` and `renderers` are used\r\n- How to build a Codama IDL from scratch\r\n- How to build a Codama IDL from an Anchor IDL and update it if needed\r\n\r\n## Next Steps\r\n\r\nYou're now ready to start building your first SDK with Codama! The best way to solidify your knowledge is through hands-on practice. We encourage you to:\r\n\r\n1. Head to the [Challenges section](/en/challenges)\r\n2. Create an SDK for one of the program\r\n3. Use the SDK to build some test for your program\r\n4. Join our community to share your progress and get help\r\n\r\n","highlightedCode":{}}